OL,3,GNEWSATravel disrupted and events
OL,4,Acancelled as Storm Boelo hits UK with
OL,5,Awind and rain
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Met Office has issued six weather
OL,8,Fwarnings covering much of the UK
OL,9,Fbetween Saturday and Sunday - three are
OL,10,Falready in effect
OL,12,FAmber warnings for wind in northern
OL,13,FEngland, Scotland, and parts of
OL,14,FNorthern Ireland begin at 21:00
OL,16,FFriday's storm brought widespread power
OL,17,Fcuts, particularly in south-west
OL,18,FEngland - National Grid says it has
OL,19,Frestored electricity to over 117,000
OL,20,Fhomes, but thousands of others are
OL,21,Fstill waiting to be reconnected
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
